  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math> is the number of irrational terms in the expansion of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mn>3</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>60</mn></msup></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is divisible by :"
  },
